   116	## Roles
   117	
   118	Exactly one coordinator is active. A handoff becomes effective only after the
   119	outgoing coordinator banks an atomic `LIVE STATE` and the incoming coordinator
   120	acknowledges its basis; research and review lanes may otherwise remain active.
   121	
   122	- **Coordinator / integrator** — owns the scientific schedule and global
   123	  synthesis. It freezes round inputs, keeps the claim and avenue dependencies
   124	  legible, allocates capacity, adjudicates conflicting reports, attacks the
   125	  hardest integrative gap, banks state, and surfaces human-only decisions. The
   126	  strongest available reasoner should spend most of its time here or on the
   127	  one problem for which global context has the highest marginal value, not on
   128	  routine replay or documentation.
   129	- **Research lane** — one bounded prove, disprove, compute, implement, or
   130	  survey task. It names its input claims and permitted assumptions, owns its
   131	  task end-to-end, and writes one `xmodel/<tag>.md` report plus replayable
   132	  artifacts when applicable. It does not edit shared ledgers.
   133	- **Adversarial reviewer** — independently tries to break one claim by source
   134	  comparison, counterexample search, and direct replay. It reports a verdict
   135	  for each exact claim: `CONFIRMED`, `REFUTED`, or `GAP`, with the attack and
   136	  computation shown. It must not be the producer model.
   137	- **External-intelligence lane** — searches broadly for new results, actors,
   138	  artifacts, corrections, and priority changes; snapshots exact sources and
   139	  maps actionable items into campaign claims and avenues.
   140	- **Software / compute lane** — improves instruments or runs registered
   141	  experiments. New tools carry an internal/unreviewed label until their gates
   142	  and any claim they support are independently reviewed.
   143	
   144	Persistent avenue owners preserve depth. At every ideation round, rotating
   145	fresh-eyes lanes independently scan the whole campaign before receiving any
   146	narrower lens.
