   404	Target 60 minutes for blind submissions, 30 for cross-pollination, and 30 for
   405	synthesis. Close a round within two hours when possible; if an ideator misses
   406	the close, mark the round `DEGRADED` instead of blocking ongoing research.
   407	Events arriving after the snapshot are queued for the next micro/full round
   408	and never silently mutate the sealed packet.
