   412	`xmodel/ideation-<YYYYMMDDTHHMMZ>-synthesis.md`.
   413	
   414	### External web sweep — at least every 24 hours
   415	
   416	No more than 24 hours may pass between completed broad sweeps. Low-cost alerts
   417	and known-actor watches run between sweeps when available. An external event
   418	can trigger both immediate intake and a full ideation round.
   419	
   420	The sweep covers broad phrase/concept searches as well as arXiv, repositories,
   421	Zenodo, MathOverflow, Palomar and its public discussion channels, relevant
   422	social feeds, citations, and the known-actor watchlist. Date-windowed searches
   423	are supplemental, because old but newly discovered artifacts have already
   424	escaped them.
   425	
   426	Classify an item `ACTIONABLE` only if it can change correctness, route rank,
   427	priority/publication posture, artifacts, or actor status. For each actionable
   428	item: preserve URL and timestamp, snapshot or hash the artifact, extract the
   429	exact claim without overreading it, replay the cheapest decisive check, map it
   430	to the claim DAG and avenue graph, and assign follow-up. Bank a negative sweep
   431	too; absence of a hit is weak evidence, not evidence of absence.
   432	
   433	### Classical frontier admissibility gate
   434	
   435	Before registering compute, every lane must state separately the actual total
   436	degrees, partial-`y` degrees, weighted degrees, and whether any total/
   437	coefficient-`x` cap is finite.  It must then reconcile that honest scope with
   438	the classical closed-case ledger and primary sources.  In particular, the
   439	Guccione--Guccione--Valqui/Heitmann theorem requires
   440	`gcd(deg_total P,deg_total Q) >= 16` for a characteristic-zero
   441	counterexample.  Thus every envelope with both total degrees at most `12`
   442	and every explicitly registered fixed actual-total pair such as `(9,12)` or
   443	`(8,12)` is counterexample-closed.  Historical `max12` and “maximum-12” tags
   444	normally name a maximum actual partial-`y`-degree frontier; they never
   445	establish a finite coefficient-`x` or total-degree cap.  Only an explicit
   446	actual-total pair or total cap licenses `METHOD_CONTROL_ONLY`; an unbounded-
   447	total partial-`y` lane remains `NOT_CLOSED_BY_THIS_GATE` unless another
   448	theorem closes its exact scope.
   449	
   450	For the mechanically covered cases, attach the deterministic output of
