+## Detailed card 1 — `GOLD-36-SPLICE` (new mechanism; strongest proof and falsification attack)
+
+**Object and hypotheses.** Work over a characteristic-zero field containing `rho`, with `rho^2-3rho+1=0`, `t=1-rho`, `H=p^2(p+g)(p+t g)^2`, and the canonical `R_s,F,P0,g_c,xi_s` of the frozen golden report. Charge only its ROOT-CHECKED PROVISIONAL non-H-divisible consequence `j=12`, `ord xi>=5`, `ord P0(g_c,p)>=15`; the H-divisible case is excluded from this card (`provisional-golden-proof.md:1-20,392-408`). The accepted receiver face supplies the full unequal-face scalar relation (`minimal-receiver.md:92-106,144-148`). Evidence tier here is **INTERNAL-UNREVIEWED exact derivation conditional on that provisional source arrow**.
+
+At `j=12`, integrality of the two remaining orders makes the regime-A initial from `provisional-golden-proof.md:258-310` exactly
+
+```text
+P=Y^6+uY,
+Q=Y^10+(5/3)uY^5+e,
