+## Detailed card 1 — `GOLD-36-SPLICE` (new mechanism; strongest proof and falsification attack)
+
+**Object and hypotheses.** Work over a characteristic-zero field containing `rho`, with `rho^2-3rho+1=0`, `t=1-rho`, `H=p^2(p+g)(p+t g)^2`, and the canonical `R_s,F,P0,g_c,xi_s` of the frozen golden report. Charge only its ROOT-CHECKED PROVISIONAL non-H-divisible consequence `j=12`, `ord xi>=5`, `ord P0(g_c,p)>=15`; the H-divisible case is excluded from this card (`provisional-golden-proof.md:1-20,392-408`). The accepted receiver face supplies the full unequal-face scalar relation (`minimal-receiver.md:92-106,144-148`). Evidence tier here is **INTERNAL-UNREVIEWED exact derivation conditional on that provisional source arrow**.
+
+At `j=12`, integrality of the two remaining orders makes the regime-A initial from `provisional-golden-proof.md:258-310` exactly
+
+```text
+P=Y^6+uY,
+Q=Y^10+(5/3)uY^5+e,
+u=U p^(1/2), e=E p.
+```
+
+Indeed the critical value is later than `2r=24/5` and `q0>=15>6r`, so neither quadratic constant `b` nor `v` occurs. Direct differentiation, in the declared field extension and bracket convention, gives
+
+```text
+[P,Q]=(6E-(10/3)U^2)Y^5+U E p^(1/2).
+```
+
+The transformed source target has no `Y^5` term. Hence `E=5U^2/9`, and its constant is `5U^3 p^(1/2)/9`. If `alpha^2=t(t-1)`, the transverse coefficient from `P0_12=lambda p(p+g)(p+t g)` is `U=lambda(t-1)/alpha`, while the target is `c p^(1/2)/(t^2 alpha)` (`provisional-golden-proof.md:150-165,291-310`). Therefore resonance forces
+
+```text
+c=(5/9) lambda^3 t (t-1)^2.                 (local)
+```
+
+But the accepted unequal face has low coefficient `a=lambda t` and outer coefficient `kappa_face=rho=t^2`, so its exact relation is
+
+```text
+c=-(5/9)a^3/kappa_face=-(5/9)lambda^3 t.    (global)
+```
+
+Equality would give `(t-1)^2=-1`, whereas `(t-1)^2+1=rho^2+1=3rho` is nonzero. This is the splice contradiction.
